Yes.  Connect up to the console port (the 9 pin connector) and power up the 
DECbrouter.  When you get the initial booting message, type a {break}.

This will get you to the console where you can enter commands to override 
the startup default.  I believe O/R 0x2102 will open up the DECbrouter such
that you can see the configuration of the device.  If the passowrd is in one
of the "hashed" formats, your best bet is to configure it to some passowrd
of your own choosing.

