I've had two problems similar to this on DS20E. In each case:

There was no error log entry
There was no crash dump
There was no console output
The system did not respond to the reset button
Power off/on got it running
It was intermittent.

The first was a motherboard fault.
The second was processor 0 crashing. Eventually spotted with $SHOW CPU after
the power off/on. It came up in single CPU mode on CPU1.

