This error occurs because VMS doesn't support the PCI IDE interface
chip in the PWS500. You will need to use a SCSI CD-ROM instead.

This error is one of the signposts of the difference between a
PWS---a and a PWS---au. The ---au machines have a supported PCI IDE
interface, the ---a's do not.

